xt_original":"順調ね、続けましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/3afX95p129cz4VwXFuZpW9Hh86COggv1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEvent_FindTreasure_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"いい傾向ね、悪くないわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/sOpZ33Hs719z9tRHheyYD01eibVoB2jQ.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventBoxshop_SPBuy_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"なるほど。良いものを当てたわね。おめでとう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/ByKWkugrwNe50MBKEmZSnAGbOiuluOb3.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventBoxshop_SPBuy_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"ああ、これは良い商品よ。私が保証するわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/Bz0Y65W7REaUDTa5pj0Hy5zB8vqymocf.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventBoxshop_SPBuy_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"おめでとう。やはり先生は幸運の持ち主なのね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/onz4OAtsitQkgGDbjlwGnwCdAbzJRrn6.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventCardpickup_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"まさか当てるだなんて......すごいわね、先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/sKLPqAvf9uzLAZeSHmeKsskQbqOEaEvb.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventCardpickup_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"悪くないわね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/GCQoUxflPmERW0TmHRbCFsnnz45UW2UR.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventCardpickup_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"良いと思うわ。  ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/Z7VZ8W9ubOgJQUtQKU6IH2AFbCJk9G09.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventCardpickup_4","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"まだまだあるもの。続けていきましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/xr4AzscCjCONADqsdaSYhpmpHE28cHb9.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLobby_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"あら、何かあったのかしら？ 困っている事があるのなら、なんでも相談してちょうだい。 私は、先生の補佐としてここにいるのだから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/GuNPDYvuRnZI9jiLA2NP2qVjZtT6IyZr.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLobby_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"そう警戒しないでちょうだい。 …私も傷つくのよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/E4iBjpzuAW87oH30G6CcAJBgx37KKsdU.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLobby_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"あの…私の事はいいから、 あっちを確認してちょうだい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/C2ow8HSJes9ocOED99w06QcNOv2DUqyR.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLobby_4","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"だから、私の事はいいから…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/qvG7H7vAMlhCZtsxAHozNnNNx7ixSk86.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLobby_5","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"少し集中してもらえるかしら？ いえ、私ではなく、仕事に…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/C0z4dOyU7iAFBRU6dmlFWFsE5lan2CNE.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLogin_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"待っていたわ、先生。時間を無駄にはできないの。 さあ、早速はじめましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/QHGxehkCeznMTPvMiIUXzPVCdIH3pGWO.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLogin_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"これが本日の業務内容。先生の活躍、期待しているわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/4rxqdkPz1rRUZgHfMK3HhgVNGLMH3kIr.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLogin_Season_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"まだ事態は終わっていないわ。 気を引き締めていきましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/H5padTkR1zQb5yt2LK2HIpKjeif89fg7.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLogin_Season_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"終わりが見えてきたわね。 最後まで、向上心を忘れないように。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/VcpCelDzOjBNnB2YZkQd8VBI4T9cVnYr.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventLogin_Season_End","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"無事終了したわね。 やり残しがないか、今のうちに確認してちょうだい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/pKz3LWguy9h4KNKkSMjJpqP6XI7mPW7r.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventMission_Day_End","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"本日の業務はこれですべてね。お疲れ様、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/HG8YATxz4nTXY7H7jSUkVtpqeoNpHR3Y.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventMission_Get_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"はい、お疲れ様、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/Gm4lHOCYQJFnm3F9U7rpQth69aXG9alU.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventMission_Get_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"これで解決ね。ありがとう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/kn725efR0zAEcshbxqeWjVlwVlJVoBu2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventShop_Buy_1","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"それを選んだの。なるほど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/TDgrfbX4nJFGrJAi6Vf0y67wOuAiLzBb.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventShop_Buy_2","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"ふむ…私も異論はないわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/Y6M1cJjlXr9CzLtJurBtzcQJB4lQ6JyP.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventShop_Buy_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"そう、良い判断だと思うわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/SfUYC3FUzoARUwDlB6DcGUz3b7njC7ej.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventShop_Buy_4","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"先生にとって、それが必要なのね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/3mbTMDrKwMIu6labUAr70H4AFYAHaLJF.ogg"},{"description":"NP0032_MiniEventShop_End","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"おかげで助かったわ、先生。 次回もまた、お願いしてもいいかしら？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/df54TpV6iHz03ScdvXt8vNaC3gxawufy.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"np0032_minieventboxshop_spbuy_1","category":"other","text":"原来如此， 您抽到了好东西呢，恭喜。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventboxshop_spbuy_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventboxshop_spbuy_2","category":"other","text":"啊啊，这个东西很棒呢， 我可以保证。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventboxshop_spbuy_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventboxshop_spbuy_3","category":"other","text":"恭喜， 老师运气果然很好呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventboxshop_spbuy_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventcardpickup_1","category":"other","text":"不会抽到了那个东西吧…… 老师好厉害。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventcardpickup_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventcardpickup_2","category":"other","text":"唔，还不坏嘛。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventcardpickup_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventcardpickup_3","category":"other","text":"也还不错嘛？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventcardpickup_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventcardpickup_4","category":"other","text":"其他的还有剩，继续吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventcardpickup_4.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlobby_1","category":"other","text":"嗯，您遇到了什么问题吗？因为我是老师的助手，所以遇到困难的话， 请尽管和我说。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlobby_2","category":"other","text":"不要这么生分嘛。……我也是会受伤的哦？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlobby_3","category":"other","text":"嗯……不用担心我，先去确认一下那边吧，","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlobby_4","category":"other","text":"都说了不用担心我了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlobby_5","category":"other","text":"能不能专心一点？不，不是说对我， 是对工作……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlogin_1","category":"other","text":"老师，我等您很久了。那事不宜迟， 我们马上开始吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlogin_2","category":"other","text":"这是今天的工作内容， 期待您的表现。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlogin_season_1","category":"other","text":"一切还没结束，打起精神继续前进吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlogin_season_2","category":"other","text":"终点就在眼前。但直到结束之前， 都请保持上进心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventlogin_season_end","category":"other","text":"顺利结束了。请检查一下 是否有剩余的工作吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventmission_day_end","category":"other","text":"今天的工作就到此结束了。  辛苦了。老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventmission_day_end.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventmission_get_1","category":"other","text":"嗯，老师您辛苦了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventmission_get_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventmission_get_2","category":"other","text":"这个也解决了呢，谢谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventmission_get_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventshop_buy_1","category":"other","text":"选择了那个吗？ 原来如此。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventshop_buy_1.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventshop_buy_2","category":"other","text":"嗯，好的， 我也没有异议。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventshop_buy_2.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventshop_buy_3","category":"other","text":"原来如此， 我认为这个决定很棒。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventshop_buy_3.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventshop_buy_4","category":"other","text":"原来老师需要这个啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventshop_buy_4.ogg"},{"description":"np0032_minieventshop_end","category":"other","text":"谢谢您帮助我，老师。下次也可以请您帮忙吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89%87%E5%96%9C%20%E8%91%B5/original/cn/np0032_minieventshop_end.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"np0032_minieventboxshop_spbuy_3","category":"other","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%89